#: ../../guide/loading_tools.rst:2 190decca2daf40c2a3dd5be878c37cd3
msgid "Tool Loading Tutorial"
msgstr "工具加载教程"

#: ../../guide/loading_tools.rst:4 d48059063edb4efca64e2d768d24a581
msgid "**Complete Tutorial to loading and managing tools in ToolUniverse**"
msgstr "**完整教程：加载和管理 ToolUniverse 中的工具**"

#: ../../guide/loading_tools.rst:6 6512096a0b7d490fb8ec6f7f968a8360
msgid ""
"This Tutorial covers two main approaches to load and access ToolUniverse "
"tools: Python API using ``load_tools()`` method and MCP (Model Context "
"Protocol) server using terminal commands."
msgstr ""
"本教程介绍了加载和访问ToolUniverse工具的两种主要方法：通过Python "
"API使用``load_tools()``方法，以及通过终端命令使用MCP（模型上下文协议）服务器。"

#: ../../guide/loading_tools.rst:9 e3537f32e97f4787b8b56eaedb73223f
msgid "Python API: Using load_tools()"
msgstr "Python API：使用 load_tools()"

#: ../../guide/loading_tools.rst:11 c0260ba841df41a0aa3538fd5b0e8338
msgid ""
"The ``load_tools()`` method is the primary way to load tools when using "
"ToolUniverse programmatically in Python."
msgstr "``load_tools()`` 方法是使用 Python 以编程方式操作 ToolUniverse 时加载工具的主要方式。"

#: ../../guide/loading_tools.rst:14 e2599698e778489092068ecdb441f811
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"**For complete Python API documentation**, see :doc:`../api/modules` for "
"the full API reference."
msgstr ""
"**完整的 Python API 文档**，请参见 :doc:`../api/modules` 获取完整 API 参考。"

#: e858a856237e40eb84687e8ef86ee978 of
#: tooluniverse.execute_function.ToolUniverse.load_tools:1
msgid "Load tools into the instance, with optional filtering."
msgstr "将工具加载到实例中，并支持可选过滤。"

#: ../../guide/loading_tools.rst 35c9fe4a67714474ba6ae1d03a240ec5
msgid "Parameters"
msgstr "参数"

#: 37d7b8bcbfd644e0ad1a706beae99131 of
#: tooluniverse.execute_function.ToolUniverse.load_tools:3
msgid ""
"Tool category names to load. If None, all categories are loaded. Use "
"``list_categories()`` to see available names."
msgstr "要加载的工具类别名称。如果为 None，则加载所有类别。可使用 ``list_categories()`` 查看可用名称。"

#: 639c43113de84296b9c1f5d41f6e0be5 of
#: tooluniverse.execute_function.ToolUniverse.load_tools:6
msgid "Deprecated alias for ``categories``."
msgstr "``categories`` 的已弃用别名。"

#: 98ae69bb7abf46a2a1654be547618b88 of
#: tooluniverse.execute_function.ToolUniverse.load_tools:8
msgid ""
"Tool names to exclude. Supports glob patterns (e.g. "
"``[\"EuropePMC_*\"]``)."
msgstr "要排除的工具名称。支持 glob 模式（例如 ``[\"EuropePMC_*\"]``）。"

#: 9fdad05b48c14f6b9b57b1c573661c1b of
#: tooluniverse.execute_function.ToolUniverse.load_tools:11
msgid "Category names to skip entirely."
msgstr "需要完全跳过的类别名称。"

#: e79cd22fbd8040a6ac831a7399d590b2 of
#: tooluniverse.execute_function.ToolUniverse.load_tools:13
msgid ""
"Only load these tools. Supports glob patterns (e.g. ``[\"EuropePMC_*\", "
"\"ChEMBL_*\"]``). Pass a file path string to read names from a text file "
"(one per line)."
msgstr "仅加载这些工具。支持 glob 模式（例如 ``[\"EuropePMC_*\", \"ChEMBL_*\"]``）。也可以传入文件路径字符串，从文本文件中逐行读取工具名。"

#: dc13aca0805e4af2adeb42dcd2d11058 of
#: tooluniverse.execute_function.ToolUniverse.load_tools:17
#, fuzzy, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Extra JSON config files to load. Format: ``{\"category_name\": "
"\"/path/to/config.json\"}``."
msgstr "要加载的额外 JSON 配置文件。格式：``{\"category_name\": \"/path/to/config.json\"}``。"

#: 59b57d7eb5034258af76339bb926e6f7 of
#: tooluniverse.execute_function.ToolUniverse.load_tools:20
msgid "Deprecated. Pass a file path to ``include_tools`` instead."
msgstr "已弃用。请改为向 ``include_tools`` 传入文件路径。"

#: 1e0bc0393e0b498ebfb79e4950bf7a51 of
#: tooluniverse.execute_function.ToolUniverse.load_tools:23
msgid ""
"List of Python file paths (str or Path) to import as user tools. Each "
"file should contain ``@register_tool``-decorated classes. Example: "
"``python_files=[\"/path/to/my_tool.py\"]``."
msgstr "要作为用户工具导入的 Python 文件路径列表（str 或 Path）。每个文件都应包含使用 ``@register_tool`` 装饰的类。例如：``python_files=[\"/path/to/my_tool.py\"]``。"

#: bfeb1a2d2df141d891b81ac7ba50e648 of
#: tooluniverse.execute_function.ToolUniverse.load_tools:27
msgid ""
"Only load tools whose ``type`` field is in this list (e.g. "
"``[\"RESTTool\", \"GraphQLTool\"]``)."
msgstr "仅加载 ``type`` 字段位于此列表中的工具（例如 ``[\"RESTTool\", \"GraphQLTool\"]``）。"

#: 1e8eff6d58714498a84bdf8f962d9ef1 of
#: tooluniverse.execute_function.ToolUniverse.load_tools:30
msgid "Skip tools whose ``type`` field is in this list."
msgstr "跳过 ``type`` 字段位于此列表中的工具。"

#: 08b0183488b5451c8fd117abc729b09d of
#: tooluniverse.execute_function.ToolUniverse.load_tools:33
msgid ""
"Suppress missing-API-key warnings and ``.env.template`` generation. "
"Default ``True``. Pass ``False`` to see which keys are missing."
msgstr "抑制缺失 API 密钥的警告以及 ``.env.template`` 的生成。默认值为 ``True``。传入 ``False`` 可查看缺失了哪些密钥。"

#: c2af9fcdebb346bd98e6f3da33b2aa16 of
#: tooluniverse.execute_function.ToolUniverse.load_tools:38
msgid "Examples"
msgstr "示例"

#: f4cc5565c0134d85af422593a5233d41 of
#: tooluniverse.execute_function.ToolUniverse.load_tools:40
